cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this skill in your research, please cite it and disclose AI assistance per your institution's policy."
title: "Academic Researcher — The Researcher's Operating System (a Claude Skill)"
abstract: "An end-to-end Claude Agent Skill that supports the full lifecycle of academic research, from a first journal paper to a PhD by publication (thesis by published works): research-programme planning, supervision, simulated examination committee, quality-scored peer review, adversarial review sweeps, rival-mechanism auditing, reading-ledger discipline, power simulation, revision coaching, citation and evidence integrity auditing, literature mastery, and viva preparation. Built for independent and thinly-supervised researchers."
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Scottthe3rd/academic-researcher-skill"
